{"words": [{"text": "أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "Those"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "(are) on"}, {"text": "هُدًۭى", "translation": "Guidance"}, {"text": "مِّن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "رَّبِّهِمْ ۖ", "translation": "their Lord"}, {"text": "وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "and those "}, {"text": "هُمُ", "translation": "they"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُفْلِحُونَ", "translation": "(are) the successful ones"}], "sahih": "Those are upon [right] guidance from their Lord, and it is those who are the successful."}